299	     * Rejects an owner whose required text fields are blank (whitespace-only). Missing (null)
300	     * and empty fields are already rejected by Bean Validation on {@link OwnerFieldsDto}; this
301	     * closes the gap for {@code address} and {@code city}, whose values may be non-empty yet
302	     * blank (e.g. {@code "   "}). The offending field names are reported through an
303	     * {@link InvalidOwnerFieldsException}, which the {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice} renders
304	     * as a 400 response carrying an {@code errors} array of field names.
