397	     * compared case-insensitively (using {@link java.util.Locale#ROOT}-independent
398	     * {@link String#equalsIgnoreCase(String)}). The count reflects the owners present before the
399	     * current create, so a name that is unique on create yields {@code 0}. The value is stored on the
400	     * new owner and surfaced as the read-only {@code namesakeCount} field.
401	     *
